<title>UK: INSIGHT-Gold seen in range, PGMs may try upside.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-Gold seen in range, PGMs may try upside.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> SPOT     NY CLOSE  * SUPPORT * RESIST * RSI14 *   MA10 *   MA30</p>
<p> GOLD   341.50/2.00 *  340.00 * 346.50 *    44 * 342.44 * 343.70</p>
<p> SILVER   4.79/4.81 *    4.70 *   4.90 *    54 *   4.75 *   4.76</p>
<p> PLAT   411.00/6.00 *  400.00 * 430.00 *    47 * 441.01 * 409.99</p>
<p>-----------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET --June 18---------------</p>
<p>Gold is seen continuing to hold in a $340-$345 range in the short term, but the PGMs may be bottoming out ahead of another thrust higher, dealers and analysts said on Wednesday.</p>
